        "This Engagement Agreement (\"Agreement\") is entered into by and between J Brantley Law, PLLC (\"Attorney\" or \"Firm\"), and the undersigned individual or entity (\"Client\"), collectively the \"Parties.\"",
        "Thank you for considering Attorney Jennifer Brantley and J Brantley Law, PLLC, for the copyright registration services described below. This letter sets forth the terms under which the Firm will represent Client in connection with registration of Client’s {{answers.work_title}} (the \"Work\") with the United States Copyright Office.",
        "No attorney-client relationship exists between Attorney and Client, and no work will commence under this Agreement, until: (1) this Agreement has been signed by Client and countersigned by Attorney; and (2) the applicable deposit described in Section 4(B) has been received and confirmed by the Firm. Prior communications between the parties, including any consultation call, do not by themselves establish an attorney-client relationship."
