        "Nothing in this Agreement or in Attorney’s statements to Client should be construed as a promise or guarantee regarding registration or the outcome of this matter. Any estimate of fees, costs, or timelines given by Attorney or non-attorney staff is not a guarantee. Current Copyright Office processing times for online applications commonly range from several months to longer, depending on the type of claim and any correspondence required, and are outside Attorney’s control."
